  "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size: 36px\"><strong>About Us</strong></span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">TodayTourist – Travel All the Way</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">TODAYTOURISTQ – GIVING YOUR FIVING FIVING IN 1907</p><p>Thank you. First of all, the staff staff Công ty Du lịch TodayTouristQ sends their regards to the Ladies and Families<strong>Health – safe – prosperous.</strong></p><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-01.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><p>TodayTouristQ is the Professional Travel Unit at the Plain Nai, with<strong>More than 10 years of experience</strong>in the realm of tourism in the international &amp;, teambuilding – gala – event, design tours, as required for odd guests, families, businesses, and groups.</p><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-02.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-02.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><p>With the junior staff – dynamic – experienced, TodayTouristQQ confidently responds to diverse needs, including the most difficult customers, bringing the journeys<em>Complete – Security – Memorable</em>Yeah.</p><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-03.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-03.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><p>Towards the goal to become the top luxury tourist brand in the Southern area, TodayTouristQ consistently enhances service quality, improves product and optimizes customer experience on every journey.</p><h2>core value [u]</h2><ul><li>BRAZIL<strong>Qualified Service Quality</strong></li><li>BRAZIL<strong>Professional Workstyle</strong></li><li>BRAZIL<strong>The cost is reasonable – transparency</strong></li><li>BRAZIL<strong>Make the customer's satisfaction the center</strong></li></ul><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-04.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-04.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><h2>QQ8Q Mission</h2><blockquote>“ Customers laugh as the basis for sustainable growth. ”</blockquote><p>Thank you for your trust and choice of TodayTouristQ.</p><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-05.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-05.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><h2>Organisation</h2><p><span style=\"color:#115e59\">Unit name:</span>CÔNG TY DU LỊCH TODAYTOURIST</p><p><span style=\"color:#115e59\">Address:</span>Number 80 Dew, District 29, Terence Long Ping, TP. Border, Plain Nai</p><p><span style=\"color:#115e59\">\"QQ0 Business Advisory:</span>Mr. Royal: 0933.92.49.79Q; Mr. English: 0902.898.726Q; Ms. Qingý: 0937.001.448QQ; Mr. Hum: 0835.082.129Q</p><p><span style=\"color:#115e59\">Hotline:</span> <a href=\"tel:0913787647\">0913.78.76.47</a>(Lie Sang)</p><p><span style=\"color:#115e59\">Email:</span> <a href=\"mailto:lesangtravel@gmail.com\">lesangtravel@gmail.com</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#115e59\">Website:</span> <a href=\"https://todaytourist.com\">todaytourist.com</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#115e59\">The motto:</span>Travel all the way – Full faith</p><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-06.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-06.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-07.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-07.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-08.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-08.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: rgba(31, 42, 55, 0.12) 0px 6px 18px;\"></figure></div><div class=\"se-component se-image-container __se__float-center\"><figure><img src=\"/content/vi/images/about-09.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-proportion=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-file-name=\"about-09.jpg\" data-file-size=\"0\" data-origin=\",auto\" data-size=\",\" data-rotate=\"\" data-percentage=\"auto,auto\" style=\"border-radius